  "title": "Grandma's Povitica (Croatian Nut Roll)",
  "description": "Povitica, a Croatian nut bread roll, is made with a sweet yeast bread dough wrapped around a delicious walnut filling.",
  "authors": [
    "Stephani"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:57:36-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2025-09-22T17:24:48-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT45M",
  "cook_time": "PT40M",
  "total_time": "PT295M",
  "yield": [
    "12",
    "1 loaf"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Dessert"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "European"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "European"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "0.25 cup warm water",
    "1 (.25 ounce) package active dry yeast",
    "0.75 cup lukewarm milk",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "0.25 cup vegetable shortening (such as Crisco®)",
    "1 egg, beaten",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "3.5 cups all-purpose flour, or more as needed",
    "0.5 cup brown sugar",
    "0.25 cup butter, softened",
    "1 egg",
    "0.25 cup milk",
    "0.5 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "0.5 teaspoon lemon extract",
    "2 cups finely chopped walnuts"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ch_e8w9qOD2xXzjAodwLPa37DEY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235811-grandmas-povitica-croatian-nut-bread-VAT-step-01-2c216f4dd5d6445487bb1440770e8d4b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235811/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make bread dough: Combine warm water and yeast together in a large bowl. Let stand until yeast softens and forms a creamy foam, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7gOrzjiXjCaEVQ1BfUuiGoMUhCo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235811-grandmas-povitica-croatian-nut-bread-VAT-step-02-1874b0bcdb344cba92e0abd9704a7d96.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235811/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir lukewarm milk, white sugar, shortening, egg, and salt into yeast mixture. Mix in flour until a soft, easy-to-handle dough forms.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JUrcdoaESabzg1cN8EKFNLrmlWc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235811-grandmas-povitica-croatian-nut-bread-VAT-step-03-1263bcf86d2f40278c3103e45d16ac5c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235811/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn dough out onto a lightly floured surface and let stand for 10 minutes. Knead dough until smooth and elastic, about 8 minutes. Form dough into a ball.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/h334nOtmS5b5GvJr7qaZ7Ym3EYw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235811-grandmas-povitica-croatian-nut-bread-VAT-step-04-d95e5329cb9e4ad2a19e02748ecabd1e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235811/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place dough in a large, lightly-oiled bowl and turn to coat. Cover the bowl with a damp towel; let rise in a warm place until doubled in volume or until a hole remains when dough is pressed, about 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/30W3NiivzQqFzAJOkW1mtxyC4tg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235811-grandmas-povitica-croatian-nut-bread-VAT-step-05-243bdda766a9408ca4247744e28b62df.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235811/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Punch down dough and turn onto a lightly floured surface. Shape into a ball and let dough rest for 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PTreatyFIZ2QTdAk-cnseFJpEH8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235811-grandmas-povitica-croatian-nut-bread-VAT-step-06-e682d270781a43269a4378897b72ab77.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235811/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make filling: Beat brown sugar, butter, and egg together in a bowl until creamy. Add milk, vanilla extract, and lemon extract; stir until smooth. Stir in walnuts until incorporated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EZ8Ws0ODvNUcTHucl80WxTBKKVs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235811-grandmas-povitica-croatian-nut-bread-VAT-step-07-e4415354a4fd46d2a767e99d24698667.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235811/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll dough on a large, floured cloth into a 20x30-inch rectangle. Spread walnut filling evenly over top of dough, spreading to the edges.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pCSYw8RSZYID89EZg1ZxkhKhUZo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235811-grandmas-povitica-croatian-nut-bread-VAT-step-08-a35cba82d24d4c9c949b4f4ed087da0a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235811/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll up along the long edge like a jelly roll and pinch edges to seal. Coil roll into a snail shape.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/X1xpQbXM9N4dGVyL9amlVdhuiXY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235811-grandmas-povitica-croatian-nut-bread-VAT-step-09-456259b5556f4a26898f360e42760141.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235811/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grease a 9x13x2-inch baking sheet. Place shaped dough on the prepared sheet and let rise until an impression remains when dough is gently pressed, about 1 hour. Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ztbKdSQx002NT56WZE_-46zaY2U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235811-grandmas-povitica-croatian-nut-bread-VAT-step-10-c0e32f760f7e4a7f8dbd7b7aa94aaeef.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235811/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until top is golden brown, 40 to 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eSQInUYAkOOGRSoaI2aGKuq9Efw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235811-grandmas-povitica-croatian-nut-bread-VAT-step-11-fdd644f4b33e47ca94ea197722dbd2f3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235811/step_11.webp"
    }
  ],
